flowchart TB
  accTitle: A queue separates redirect requests from visit totals
  accDescr: A browser receives a redirect from the URL service. The service submits a visit event to a queue. A worker consumes the event and updates visit totals.
  B["Browser"] -->|"GET /abc"| S["URL service"]
  S -->|"Redirect<br/>response"| B
  S -->|"Submit visit<br/>event"| Q["Message queue"]
  Q -->|"Deliver event"| W["Visit worker"]
  W -->|"Update total"| D[("Visit totals")]
